    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148">

                <pb facs="0292" n="198" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg198"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Adelson, representative New York Life, here. Informs me he has nothing more to
                    present to Prussian ministry of state either in the form of statement or
                    argument.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
